# Test-run scratch output. Removed from tracking 2026-08-15 (S9-8): the
# playwright login matrix and its account manifest carried the shared live
# test password in plaintext, 37 occurrences, tracked since the initial
# commit. Nothing in the repo reads this directory.
/output/

# Built web portal artifact (large; build & deploy outside git)
/public_html_portal/

# Transient MCP auth marker
/authenticate/

# Design-package scratch: full worktree snapshot + zip of the original repo
# (215 MB of duplicates of content already in git — keep out of history).
docs/new system design/minelink-new-design-v0.1/uploads/
docs/new system design/minelink-new-design-v0.1/zip-of-original/

# Local map-tile host key (see config/map_tiles.local.json.example)
config/map_tiles.local.json

# Firebase credentials for push notifications (see docs/push-setup.md). Never
# commit a placeholder either — a fake one breaks the Gradle plugin with an
# error that reads like a build bug, and a file that looks like a credential
# is exactly the class of thing that once shipped a live ArcGIS token from
# this repo (see the config/ comment in pubspec.yaml).
android/app/google-services.json
ios/Runner/GoogleService-Info.plist

# Golden-comparison scratch. `flutter test` writes master/test/diff PNGs here
# whenever a golden fails, and they are reproduction artifacts of one run, not
# a record of anything. Eight of them were swept into a commit on 2026-08-20 by
# a `git add -A` run right after regenerating two renders.
test/renders/failures/
